              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>Get ready for the ultimate celebration of fashion, film and creativity at the <strong><strong>13th London Fashion Film Festival 2026!</strong></strong> 🎥✨</p><p>Welcome to the <strong><strong>London Fashion Film Festival 2026 – 13th Edition</strong></strong>, bringing together fashion, cinema, art and creative talent from around the world for an unforgettable day in the heart of London.</p><p>📍 <em><em>Vue West End, Leicester Square – London</em></em><br>📅 <em><em>23 September 2026</em></em><br>🕛 <em><em>12:00 – 19:00</em></em><br>👗 <em><em>Dress Code: Elegant Red Carpet Glamour</em></em></p><p>An <strong><strong>exclusive and intimate annual celebration</strong></strong> in one of the world’s great fashion capitals, the <strong><strong>London Fashion Film Festival (LFFF)</strong></strong> shines a spotlight on the ever-evolving world of fashion film.</p><p>Now in its 13th edition, LFFF brings together creative professionals from <strong><strong>fashion, film, photography, advertising and the wider creative industries</strong></strong>, providing a platform to discover new voices, recognise outstanding talent and celebrate established visionaries from across the globe.</p><p>From fashion films and documentaries to experimental shorts, music videos and cinematic storytelling, the festival celebrates the powerful relationship between <strong><strong>fashion and the moving image</strong></strong>.</p><p>More than simply a screening event, LFFF is a place for filmmakers and creatives to <strong><strong>connect, be recognised, exchange ideas and celebrate their work together</strong></strong>.</p><h3>🌟 Programme Highlights</h3><p><strong><strong>12:00 – Red Carpet &amp; Photoshoot</strong></strong><br>Step onto the LFFF red carpet and join filmmakers, nominees, jury members, industry guests and creatives for our official photo call.</p><p><strong><strong>13:00 – Official Screening</strong></strong><br>Discover an international selection of this year’s <strong><strong>nominated films</strong></strong>, showcasing original ideas, striking visual identities and bold approaches to fashion storytelling.</p><p><strong><strong>🏆 Award Ceremony</strong></strong><br>Celebrate the outstanding achievements of this year’s filmmakers and creative teams as we announce the <strong><strong>London Fashion Film Festival 2026 Award Winners</strong></strong> across multiple categories.</p><p><strong><strong>🎤 Filmmaker &amp; Industry Q&amp;A Panel</strong></strong><br>Hear directly from filmmakers and professionals working across fashion and film as they discuss their work, creative processes, experiences and the evolving future of fashion film.</p><p><strong><strong>16:00 – After Party &amp; Networking</strong></strong><br>Continue the celebration with drinks, nibbles and networking at the bar – an opportunity to meet fellow filmmakers, artists and industry professionals in a relaxed atmosphere.</p><h3>✨ More Than a Festival</h3><p>LFFF is a <strong><strong>glamorous cultural and creative experience</strong></strong> where filmmakers, designers, photographers, models, artists and industry professionals from around the world come together through a shared passion for fashion and film.</p><p>Whether you work within the industry, are joining us to support a filmmaker, or simply love fashion, cinema and visual storytelling, we invite you to be part of an unforgettable day of <strong><strong>film, creativity, conversation, awards and red-carpet glamour</strong></strong>.</p><p>🎟 <strong><strong>Tickets are limited – secure your place and join us for the 13th London Fashion Film Festival in the heart of London.</strong></strong></p>",
